@startuml SimplifiedOverview

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
hide methods
hide attributes

title Simplified UML Overview - Aedes Population System

class Egg
class Larva
class Pupa
class Adult

class Temperature
class Precipitation

class Larvicide
class Adulticide
class SourceReduction

class BreedingSite

Egg --> Larva : hatching
Larva --> Pupa : pupation
Pupa --> Adult : emergence
Adult --> Egg : oviposition

Temperature ..> Egg : affects
Temperature ..> Larva : affects
Temperature ..> Pupa : affects
Temperature ..> Adult : affects
Precipitation ..> BreedingSite : water level

Egg --o BreedingSite : contained in
Larva --o BreedingSite : contained in
Pupa --o BreedingSite : contained in

Larvicide ..> Larva : targets
Adulticide ..> Adult : targets
SourceReduction ..> BreedingSite : removes

note "Life Stages\n(blue in full diagram)" as N1
N1 .. Egg

note "Environmental Drivers" as N2
N2 .. Temperature

note "Control Measures" as N3
N3 .. Larvicide

@enduml
